  "title": "A re-proof of Livingston's equinumerosity by twisted lifting cohomology",
  "subject": "Colourings of knots by S4 and by the connected quandles of order 6",
  "conclusion": "Every S4 transposition colouring of a knot has trivial longitude, and over each S3 colouring the transposition and 4-cycle lifts are equinumerous, re-proving Livingston's 1995 Theorems 8 and 9 by twisted lifting cohomology. Hence the connected quandles C[6,1] and C[6,2] colour every knot equally; the 2013 conjecture of Clark, Elhamdadi, Hou, Saito and Yeatman for this pair was already implied by Livingston.",
